      "text": "* Author and manage Fabric assets across Dataflows, Eventhouse,\nEventstream, Activator, Warehouse, Spark, and Power BI.\n* Query and inspect live Fabric artifacts and data sources.\n* Design and build medallion architectures\n* Diagnose Spark and Warehouse issues.\n* Migrate workloads from Databricks, Synapse, and HDInsight.\n* Search for items across workspaces.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "* Author and manage Fabric assets across Dataflows, Eventhouse, Eventstream, Activator, Warehouse, Spark, and Power BI.\n* Query and inspect live Fabric artifacts and data sources.\n* Design and build medallion architectures\n* Diagnose Spark and Warehouse issues.\n* Migrate workloads from Databricks, Synapse, and HDInsight.\n* Search for items across workspaces.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
